{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415762","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415762","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041576201:1":{"text":"その手に持っているのは……","source_cn":"你手上拿着的是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7F340CB8980500B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576202:1":{"text":"この子の名前はキキだよ！僕のぬいぐるみで、一番のお友だちなんだ！","source_cn":"它的名字叫奇奇！是我的玩偶，也是我最好的朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x596AD28BB967EF6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576203:1":{"text":"キキはすごいんだよ。一緒に遊んでくれるだけじゃなくて、悪い人に会った時は僕を守ってくれるんだ！","source_cn":"奇奇很厉害，不仅能陪我玩，还会在遇到坏人的时候保护我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD2C8C9843CB11EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576204:1":{"text":"実は、私もお気に入りのぬいぐるみを持っているんですよ……","source_cn":"其实，我也有一只最喜欢的玩偶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB15C86DD200ED6EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576205:1":{"text":"本当！？なら、きっとその子も名前があるんだよね？ね？","source_cn":"那你一定也给它起了名字！对吧对吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA335403B6363CF4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576206:1":{"text":"ええ……名前は、エリエルです……","source_cn":"是的……它的名字叫艾尔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87A8C6FB329E491D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576207:1":{"text":"エリエルは、私が落ち込んでいると、いつも慰めてくれます。夢の中でも、私を導いてくれました。","source_cn":"艾尔总是能在我失落的时候安慰我，在梦境里也是它在为我指...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5746181637B1B66B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576208:1":{"text":"わあ、エリエルもすごいんだね！","source_cn":"哇，艾尔也很厉害呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E3DF9D6E30948E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576209:1":{"text":"こんなふうに、エリエルを誰かに紹介するのは初めてなので……少し恥ずかしいですね。","source_cn":"说起来有些不好意思，我还是第一次这么郑重地向别人介绍它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CB8E5C4AB7660D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576210:1":{"text":"え、どうして？その子が君の友だちなら、もっとたくさんの人に紹介すればいいのに。","source_cn":"哎，为什么？既然它是你的好朋友，为什么不把它介绍给更多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D4C4547AA1969FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576211:1":{"text":"それは……なぜただのぬいぐるみをそんなに大切にするのか、理解できない人もいるので……時には、心ないことを言われることもあります。","source_cn":"有些人会不理解，为什么一只玩偶会对我这么重要……他们还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7B2E93B7E76633E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576212:1":{"text":"ええっ、どうして！？","source_cn":"这有什么不好理解的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F352D6458EA14FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576213:1":{"text":"だって、キキやエリエルは、僕たちが寂しいとき、いつだってそばにいてくれるんだよ！","source_cn":"当然是因为在我们孤单的时候，奇奇和艾尔总会陪在我们身边啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2483A5A4B9029C58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576214:1":{"text":"君のことを分かってくれない人たちは、そばにいてくれないどころか、君にいやな思いをさせているんでしょ？","source_cn":"那些不理解你的人不仅不会陪在你身边，反倒正是他们给你带...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60542168CC779766","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576215:1":{"text":"確かに……その人たちのことで悩んだことはあります……","source_cn":"我的确也为他们烦恼过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE369C149B083705F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576216:1":{"text":"だったら、そんな人たちの考えなんて気にしなくていいよ！","source_cn":"所以，我们就不要去管他们的想法啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD6DFD799B8967F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041576217:1":{"text":"キキやエリエルを好きだって言ってくれる人はきっといるよ。僕たちは、その人たちと友だちになればいいんだ。","source_cn":"一定会有和我们一样喜欢奇奇和艾尔的人的，我们只要和他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87F26A0A66743DB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041576218:1":{"text":"世界はとっても広いんだ。キキもエリエルも、君も僕も、きっとひとりぼっちじゃないよ！","source_cn":"世界很大很大，奇奇和艾尔，你和我，一定不会孤单的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE735E629F1B55DD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041576219:1":{"text":"そうですね……こうやって分かり合えて友だちになれた、あなたと私のように。","source_cn":"是啊……就像你和我，不就已经成为可以互相理解的朋友了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44BC395B4E21FFD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041576220:1":{"text":"ダイモン君、キキ……お二人に出会い、友だちになれたことを嬉しく思います。","source_cn":"戴蒙，奇奇……我格温妮丝，很高兴能认识你们，和你们做朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28D3BC98816E1249","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:戴蒙":{"text":"ダイモン","source":"戴蒙","st